OL,3,AFlag injunction case 'spiralling out of
OL,4,Acontrol'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe co-founder of anti-migrant group
OL,7,FRaise the Colours has said an interim
OL,8,Finjunction banning him and others from
OL,9,Fputting flags on lamp-posts in
OL,10,FBirmingham is "spiralling out of
OL,11,Fcontrol", as he learned the case could
OL,12,Fgo to trial.
OL,14,FThe High Court granted Birmingham City
OL,15,FCouncil the order on Wednesday against
OL,16,FRyan Bridge and others, after thousands
OL,17,Fof union jacks and St George's flags
OL,18,Fwere put up across the city.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
